I guess I get to go, senpai of us all!

65
00:10:46,055 --> 00:10:47,555
Eh? Yeah.
Huh? Yeah.

66
00:10:47,555 --> 00:10:49,055
Really? Does that really count?

67
00:10:49,055 --> 00:10:52,855
Senpai by like, what, an hour? Half an hour or so?

68
00:10:52,855 --> 00:10:55,055
All righty, fine!

69
00:10:55,055 --> 00:10:59,055
