So be it! Everyone, it is I, Mori Calliope of HoloMyth! What's up, everybody?

70
00:10:59,055 --> 00:11:03,555
I do a lot of things, and I've been here a while.

71
00:11:03,555 --> 00:11:06,855
Four is my favorite number, but six is good too! Michael, come here.

72
00:11:06,855 --> 00:11:09,055
Come here, come here, come here!

73
00:11:09,055 --> 00:11:12,855
Anyway, よろしく! And who's next? Who's next?
Anyway, nice to meet you! And who's next? Who's next?

74
00:11:12,855 --> 00:11:17,055
Kikkeriki! I am Takanashi Kiara from Hololive Myth!

75
00:11:17,055 --> 00:11:20,555
How's it going? It's six years...

76
00:11:20,555 --> 00:11:26,055
...and I am surrounded by Myth, Myth, Myth, Myth, Myth, Myth...

77
00:11:26,055 --> 00:11:29,555
That's my introduction. I still don't have anything in particular after six years!

78
00:11:29,555 --> 00:11:32,555
Now, what about you? Do you have a special introduction?

79
00:11:32,555 --> 00:11:35,555
Yes she does, I'm ready for it.

80
00:11:35,555 --> 00:11:39,555
Wah! Wah! Wah!

81
00:11:39,555 --> 00:11:43,055
Good morning, afternoon, evening, everyone!

82
00:11:43,055 --> 00:11:46,055
Ninomae Ina'nis of Hololive Myth!

83
00:11:46,055 --> 00:11:49,055
On this wonderful day!

84
00:11:49,055 --> 00:11:53,055
She was shaking her legs earlier! She was scared!

85
00:11:53,055 --> 00:11:54,855
I was not!

86
00:11:54,855 --> 00:11:56,555
大丈夫だよ... よしよし...
It's okay... There, there...

87
00:11:56,555 --> 00:11:58,255
It's gonna be okay.

88
00:11:58,255 --> 00:12:01,855
Don't dance too hard, you know? If you dance too hard, you'll get soft!

89
00:12:01,855 --> 00:12:04,055
Okay, everybody! Congratulations on six years!

90
00:12:04,055 --> 00:12:06,555
Shake hands, shake hands!

91
00:12:06,555 --> 00:12:09,555
And check it out! After all this time, we also have...

92
00:12:09,555 --> 00:12:12,555
We've all done live shows!

93
00:12:12,555 --> 00:12:16,055
Check out the solo outfits! We have solo outfits!

94
00:12:16,055 --> 00:12:19,555
So much has happened in these six years, huh?

95
00:12:19,555 --> 00:12:22,055
Done a lot, huh?

96
00:12:22,055 --> 00:12:26,555
I mean, I feel like six years ago, we never would have even thought that we could do that, you know?

97
00:12:26,555 --> 00:12:31,055
Do you guys still remember the very first time we met each other on Discord?

98
00:12:31,055 --> 00:12:34,555
Yeah, it was weird! It was weird.

99
00:12:34,555 --> 00:12:40,055
The introduction channel, where like everybody typed like a paragraph about themselves?

100
00:12:40,055 --> 00:12:43,555
Yeah, and you didn't mention drawing at all, so we were all so surprised!

101
00:12:43,555 --> 00:12:46,555
She was hiding it even from us!

102
00:12:47,055 --> 00:12:50,055
Well, that made it even more impressive!

103
00:12:50,055 --> 00:12:53,555
So this stream is supposed to celebrate our six years together.

104
00:12:53,555 --> 00:12:55,055
Six!

105
00:12:55,055 --> 00:12:57,555
And we have a hashtag for that, too, right here!

106
00:12:57,555 --> 00:12:59,555
#Myth6Years!

107
00:12:59,555 --> 00:13:02,055
Use it a lot on Twitter, etc.!

108
00:13:02,055 --> 00:13:06,055
Capture your favorite moments and share them with us, because we look at that stuff, you know!

109
00:13:06,055 --> 00:13:09,555
We love it! We love...

110
00:13:09,555 --> 00:13:13,055
We got six years of dancing, so...

111
00:13:13,055 --> 00:13:16,055
And we want you guys to take pictures of them, okay?

112
00:13:16,055 --> 00:13:21,055
Beautiful pictures because not only are we wearing our beautiful outfits, but we also have this beautiful stage, right?

113
00:13:21,055 --> 00:13:23,555
Yeah! High up in the sky, and...

114
00:13:23,555 --> 00:13:27,555
...and I get a feeling that the seasons will change!

115
00:13:27,555 --> 00:13:30,555
Depending upon the songs that we sing.

116
00:13:30,555 --> 00:13:33,055
That's probably true.

117
00:13:33,055 --> 00:13:36,555
And we already showed them a little bit...

118
00:13:36,555 --> 00:13:39,055
...of the seasons with the first song that we performed,

119
