Fighting down to... ガキ、ガキ！
Fighting down to... Brats, brats!

127
00:14:06,555 --> 00:14:09,555
We gotta perform, we can't eat too much candy!

128
00:14:09,555 --> 00:14:12,055
Yeah, fine, I'll move past it all.

129
00:14:12,055 --> 00:14:17,055
So that's the sassy lost child that we have here, huh?

130
00:14:17,055 --> 00:14:20,055
